    iegraf:['Graphite • IE','IE\'s graphite, made from coke.',''],
    grafP:['Acheson Furnace','8 IE graphite + 2 coke dusts + 500 mB of hydrofluoric acid → 8 nuclear graphite (provisional).','Electric graphitization with purification: the halogen sweeps out the boron.'],
    graf:['Nuclear graphite','From the Acheson Furnace.','Goes to the reactor (moderator) and to the UHP electrode.'],
    achU:['Acheson Furnace','1 IE electrode + 2 nuclear graphite → 1 UHP electrode; worn UHP + 1 nuclear graphite → UHP recovered, whole (provisional).','The same machine: upgrades IE\'s electrode and recovers it.'],
    elecU:['UHP electrode','From the Acheson Furnace.','IE\'s electrode with the UHP mark: lasts about 4 times longer.'],
